        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king declares that whoever defeats him in battle will have their wish granted.<br>███ is, like many others, a jobless robot that wants to use the wish to turn its life around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLISH ACTION ROGUE-LIKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/9f4024d8efb31bf787aea29d6216114d.poster.avif?t=1779768792\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/9f4024d8efb31bf787aea29d6216114d.webm?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/9f4024d8efb31bf787aea29d6216114d.mp4?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment and style on your enemies using the weapons you find each run, restarting over again with each death. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR STYLE MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/25b46a9a34ee9091097cc6b11a583ef3.poster.avif?t=1779768792\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/25b46a9a34ee9091097cc6b11a583ef3.webm?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/25b46a9a34ee9091097cc6b11a583ef3.mp4?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bragging is cool and all, but getting extra rewards and stronger items is even cooler! Rewards increase in quality and/or quantity depending on how cool you are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE THAN A NUMBERS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e97882ce5a48267d30d3cfafba506e96.poster.avif?t=1779768792\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e97882ce5a48267d30d3cfafba506e96.webm?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e97882ce5a48267d30d3cfafba506e96.mp4?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique items each unlocking new moves and mechanics, changing the rules of the game.</p>",
