HAN A NUMBERS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e97882ce5a48267d30d3cfafba506e96.poster.avif?t=1779768792\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e97882ce5a48267d30d3cfafba506e96.webm?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e97882ce5a48267d30d3cfafba506e96.mp4?t=1779768792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique items each unlocking new moves and mechanics, changing the rules of the game.</p>",
